ArcFace / MobileFaceNet face embedding
--------------------------------------

Files
    model/FaceEmbedding.mlpackage
    MacID.app/Contents/Resources/FaceEmbedding.mlmodelc   (built from the above)

Origin
    InsightFace <https://github.com/deepinsight/insightface>, "buffalo_s"
    model pack, recognition model `w600k_mbf.onnx`: an ArcFace MobileFaceNet
    trained on WebFace600K. Converted to Core ML for this project; the weights
    are unchanged. See model/convert.py for the conversion.

