What this means for you
    Running MacID on your own Mac is non-commercial use and is covered.

    Selling MacID, shipping it inside a product, or using it in a commercial
    service is NOT covered by the model's licence, even though this project's
    own code is MIT and would otherwise permit it. The MIT grant in LICENSE
