    to a file this project did not create.

    If you need MacID under purely permissive terms, remove the model and
    supply your own embedding: FaceEmbedder is the only file that loads it, and
    FaceEngine.Descriptor is the only type the rest of the project sees.

Why this model
    Measured through MacID's own pipeline over 767 LFW pairs, the general
    image descriptor previously used (Vision's VNGenerateImageFeaturePrint)
    separated same-person from different-person pairs at best 89%. This model
    scores 99.5% on the same pairs, at 0.0% false accepts. That difference is
    the entire reason for accepting a non-permissive file into the tree.
